#: front/index-en.html:199 front/index.html:199
msgid ""
"Since the establishment of the Quality Perfection Center in 2008, our name "
"has become synonymous with quality and trust in the world of comprehensive "
"car maintenance. We started with an ambitious vision to provide services "
"that exceed customer expectations, and we succeeded in building a wide base "
"of individual customers, companies, and government institutions. During more "
"than fifteen years of continuous work, we have proven that success is only "
"determined by commitment, perfection, and constant keenness for development."
msgstr ""

#: front/index-en.html:203 front/index.html:203
msgid "Read More"
msgstr ""

#: front/index-en.html:250 front/index.html:250
msgid "Center's Services"
msgstr ""

#: front/index-en.html:254 front/index.html:254
msgid ""
"We offer at Quality Perfection Center a wide range of integrated services"
msgstr ""

#: front/index-en.html:331 front/index.html:331
msgid "Technical Innovation & Digital Transformation"
msgstr ""

#: front/index-en.html:335 front/index.html:335
msgid ""
"We use the latest electronic inspection systems and intelligent analysis "
"tools to provide an accurate and rapid diagnosis of technical problems. We "
"also provide an online appointment booking service and a car status follow-"
"up service, which facilitates the customer experience and saves time and "
"effort"
msgstr ""

