#: front/index-en.html:414 front/index.html:414
msgid "Social & Environmental Responsibility"
msgstr ""

#: front/index-en.html:417 front/index.html:417
msgid ""
"We at Quality Perfection Center are committed to applying environmental "
"safety standards by using environmentally friendly materials and managing "
"waste in safe ways. We also participate in community initiatives to support "
"awareness of traffic safety and the preservation of vehicles"
msgstr ""

#: front/index-en.html:456 front/index.html:456
msgid "Our Clients' Stories"
msgstr ""

#: front/index-en.html:543 front/index.html:543
msgid "Future Vision & Expansion"
msgstr ""

#: front/index-en.html:544 front/index.html:544
msgid ""
"We plan to open new branches inside and outside the city of Riyadh, with the "
"introduction of smart electronic services that support the customer "
"experience and keep pace with technical development"
msgstr ""

#: front/index-en.html:562 front/index.html:562
msgid "Customer Experience and After-Sales Services"
msgstr ""

#: front/index-en.html:565 front/index.html:565
msgid ""
"Because our service does not end with delivery, we care about the smallest "
"details through follow-up and periodic maintenance services and a "
"specialized team to respond to inquiries and provide technical advice around "
"the clock"
msgstr ""

#: front/index-en.html:611 front/index.html:611
